name: capability-added
kind: inferred
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: false
note: the commit gives the surface a capability that did not exist —
  a new declared parameter type, a new opt-in contract, a join that
  refused loudly before and now works by law. Distinct from defect-closed
  (something broken became right): here nothing was wrong, the surface
  was simply smaller. The commit message should name the capability and
  its first customer so the next session inherits the seam, not just
  the diff.
